    "title": "Measurement of the Lepton Forward-Backward Asymmetry in Inclusive $B \\rightarrow X_s \\ell^+ \\ell^-$ Decays",
    "arxiv": "[hep-ex/1402.7134v2](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1402.7134)",
    "time": "2014.02.28",
    "abstract": "We report the first measurement of the lepton forward-backward asymmetry $A_{FB}$ as a function of the squared four-momentum of the dilepton system, $q^2$, for the electroweak penguin process $B \\rightarrow X_s \\ell^+ \\ell^-$ with the sum of exclusive hadronic final states containing a light kaon and at most two pions and a kaon. The data sample corresponds to an integrated luminosity of 772 fb$^{-1}$ containing $772 \\times 10^6 B \\bar{B}$ pairs obtained at the $\\Upsilon(4S)$ resonance with the Belle detector at the KEKB asymmetric-energy $e^+ e^-$ collider.",
